    "description": "<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">This is the largest hybrid sauna that we have. It is the ultimate sauna. This hybrid sauna is perfect for&nbsp;4 people. As a model in the&nbsp;<span>S</span><span>apphire</span> series, it is constructed with privacy in mind. Canadian natural red cedar wood is a perfect component to a sauna if you&rsquo;re going to spend a lot of time in it.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Hybrid saunas like this combine Harvia electric heaters, specifically designed for saunas and infra-red lamps also specific to sauna use. A combination of both types of heaters is a great way to raise body temperature to have the desired effect on your mood immediately and your health in the long-term through regular use.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">You may have read that saunas such as this particular hybrid are good for overall health, more recent scientific research only enhances this view. As more evidence in regards to saunas&rsquo; therapeutic effects emerges, they become important to maintaining a sense of well-being.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">To be suitable for outdoor use, this sauna is constructed to be robust enough to stand against challenging weather. Having a sloped or a peaked roof is a preference and has no impact on the robustness of the actual sauna.</span></p>",
